            "port_hint": "/dev/ttyUSB0",
            "baud": 460800,
            "notes": "The DevKitM-1 micro USB port goes through a bridge chip. The C3 also has native USB Serial/JTAG on GPIO18 and GPIO19, but this board does not bring it out to a connector."
        },
